Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《狂蟒之灾2：搜寻血兰》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(纽约市)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你根本就是唬我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've sold us a bill of goods, Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你承诺过会研发出 能对抗各种疾病的新药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promised new drugs to fight everything from the common cold to cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们会实现承诺的 - 对不起 探险结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll deliver everything we promised. - I'm sorry,but the adventure is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们决定执行...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're exercising our option to liquidate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜伦米契生技公司的买卖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Byron & Mitchell Research Limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克 让这些人看看 我们能让他们赚多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack,show these people how filthy rich we're gonna make them,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你不明白我在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you understand what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不朽之花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perrinia immortalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,血兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Blood Orchid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,霍顿于1892年首度发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First described in 1892 by Houghton...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他也是我们从婆罗洲取回样本前 最后一位目赌它的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the last person to see it until our team brought a sample from Borneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它休眠期七年 开花期只有半年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lies dormant for seven years, then blooms for just six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 这表示我们太走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means we just got lucky as hell,gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听过"海夫利克极限"吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone here familiar with the Hayflick limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海夫利克提出细胞在死亡前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He proposed a cell could only replicate 56 times...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能复制56次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before it died from a buildup of toxins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他相信这就是人类死亡的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to him, it's the reason we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是能超越这个极限呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what if we could transcend that limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的资料可不是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not according to our data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根据我们的研究显示 不朽之花中的一种化学成份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our research indicates the presence of a chemical in Perrinia immortalis...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以延长细胞的寿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that can significantly prolong cellular life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我无法同意这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't support this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那跟我想的一样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean what I think it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这算是医药界的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we talking about a pharmaceutical equivalent...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不老泉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the fountain of youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一定比威而钢还赚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be bigger than Viagra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你们做过人体实验了? - 还没办法做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you put this into human trials? - We can't yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,样本在初次研究后已经腐败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our sample was degraded in the initial study.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要更多的血兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more of the orchid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是唯一的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See,and that's our only problem, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种兰花只剩两周的开花期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That orchid is only in bloom for another two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你们还等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,what the hell are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快滚去婆罗洲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your asses down to Borneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(婆罗洲 帕兰省)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 欢迎莅临婆罗洲 - 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to Borneo. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这幅景象有什么问题? - 我不知道 你在里面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong with this picture? - I don't know. Let me see,you're in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们无船可用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a boat,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的公司只负责这件事:租船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your company had one responsibility: get a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你却搞砸了 - 是你们的小姐负责租船 不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you've already screwed it up. - Wait. Your girl chartered the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,珊昨晚跟船公司确认 款项没付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam confirmed with the company. They're waiting for your payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey,I've got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,款项已经付清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Payment cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那船呢? - 船不会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the boat? - It's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有船公司都暂停营运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of the charter companies have shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雨季期间没人愿意冒险去上游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one'll risk going upriver till after the rainy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那要等多久? - 二到三周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And when's that? - Two,three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种兰花最多只能再开一周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The orchid's only in bloom for one more week,tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有个本地船长叫金宋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a local captain named Jin-Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说他愿意带任何人去上游 只要价钱对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm told he'll take anyone upriver, for the right price.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你确定是这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们说是红色大门这家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said the one with the red door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面一定有人在玩俄罗斯轮盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you somebody's playing Russian roulette in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许你玩的时候 我们会走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we'll get lucky and you'll get a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个去开房间算了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,why don't you two just get a room. Come on,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊 随便你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿!嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,金宋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jin-Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,金宋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jin-Soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的印尼文真烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lndonesian sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 说英文吧 - 听说你能带我们去上游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stick to English. - We heard you could take us upriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在雨季?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In rainy season?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那可不便宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't be cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们付你两万五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can pay you 25,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我跟船长谈谈 - 你不是船长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll have a talk with the captain. - You're not the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,金宋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jin-Soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些观光客要找船 我说了雨季不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These tourists need a boat. I told them not in the rainy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你就是金宋? - 本地人取的绰号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're Jin-Soon? - Local nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫强森 比尔强森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name's Johnson. Bill Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,印尼人发音不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pronunciation thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们可以用两万五租我的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can rent my boat for 25 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是要我开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,you want me to drive it, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就得加码到五万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that'll cost you 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五万? 你喝到茫啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty grand? Are you high?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不用回答这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Don't answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不信任他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trusting him with the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 小姐 我们少废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. Lady. Let's cut the bullshit,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是有船公司肯载你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If one of the other charter companies could take you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们现在早在河上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'd be on the river by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是因为束手无策才来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You only came to me because you're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的价钱就是五万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty grand's my price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就免谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那比捡破烂的铁皮屋还恐怖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen subway cars in better shape than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它也许不中看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,she may be ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是它很给力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but she puts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈的! - 你怎么拖这么久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全球定位仪 卫星导航系统...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,you try getting a GPS locator, a Sat-Nav EchoStar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些仪器很难通过印尼海关的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and a UV spectrometer past lndonesian customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 开始抱怨了 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Complaining already. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你宁愿待办公室? - 废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You rather be back in the office? - Hell,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有周六篮球决赛贵宾券\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had courtside seats at the Garden on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我原本会坐在名人之间看球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna sit right between Spike and Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀 不会坐那个吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,man,is that our ride?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乐观点 至少天气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the bright side,Cole. At least the weather's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,队医班道格 你一定是珊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ben Douglas,team doctor. You must be Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 我们通过电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We spoke on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴你能加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad to have you aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会让你付出代价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好耶 这下好玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yeah. This could be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别妄想了 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can forget about that,dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你搞不定那个妞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one car you ain't never gonna catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总是有办法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你的成员有点欠缺经验吧? - 我带过的研究生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your team's a little green,huh? - My former grad students.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是顶尖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best in their field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,贵公司创办人的名言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a tip for Wexell-Hall:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想要拥有青年才俊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want the best young talent...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就要趁早招募\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...recruit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 我相信珊一定很有一套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I'm sure Sam's very talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我讨厌她的态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I resent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和另一位小姐可以睡这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and the other gal can stay in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的语气听起来很感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you say that, I can tell you're impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你有任何需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need anything....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是有需要 那你就惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you need anything, you're shit out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(血腥玛丽号)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,探险队就是在这里发现兰花的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,this is where the exploratory team found the orchid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,萨坦盆地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Selatan Basin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他们花了3天时间 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It took them three days to get upriver. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是在雨季之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was before the rainy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在有些水道可能很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These waterways could be dangerous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你说过能把我们安全送到的 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said you'd get us there safely. - And I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但安全并不代表快速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But safe isn't always quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们沿着河道慢慢开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll work our way up one bend at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果苗头不对 就改变航道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't like what I see, we change course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能一开始就找最快的航道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't chart the fastest route before you begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经找好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家看看吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们连结了太空总署和亚洲卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,we're uplinked in real time to NASA and AsiaSatCom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在最佳状况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,under ideal conditions...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是最快的航道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is the fastest route.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但加上过去十年的天气模式后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But once we superimpose weather patterns for the past 10 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后再加以推测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then extrapolate....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 到萨坦盆地的最佳航道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo! It's Padrang to the Selatan Basin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我太行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只剩不到一礼拜能采集兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got less than a week to get to that orchid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你无法达成任务 把钱还来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can't get the job done, give our money back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们找别人 - 我会把你们送到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and we'll get somebody who can. - I'll get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有东西攻击我 里面有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something attacked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 哦!好可怕! - 她说有东西攻击她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,my God! - She said something attacked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别...别进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你搞什么?你吓坏它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the helI'd you do? You scared him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我吓坏它?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I scared him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是小刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小刚住这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲切一点嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶心的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disgusting animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在没事了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没事 你别乱碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. Just keep your hands off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那可能有点难 但我会尽量设法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yeah. Well,it's gonna be tough, but I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 那份报告在本周内要提交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,the S-1 has to be on file before the week is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那正是重点 - 哈啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the whole point. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- S1一定要在本周内提交 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The S-1 needs to be on file before.... - Yes,we were able to get on the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要证管会的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the purpose. We need the comments from the SEC.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 抱歉 - 我只能在这里收到讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - It's the only place I can get reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快点搞定 我们要尽快准备好 - 不 那不可能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No,just get it done. Be ready to go.... - No,that's impossible....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 喂?该死! - 哈啰?巴伯?可恶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? Hello? Damn! - Hello? Bob? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,试试我的手机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.09,0:16:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一样好用 而且还免钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Works just as good, but it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许你可以用我的特制天线 增强你的收讯能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Maybe you can use my special antenna to boost your reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,青苔会阻碍我们攀爬 我们要找光滑的岩石表面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dealing with a lithophytic vine, so we want to search any rock face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这崚线看来值得一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,this ridge here seems a good bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,珊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好嘛 你觉得咧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Sam. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们年轻 单身 又在婆罗洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're young. We're single. We're in Borneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有什么好损失的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you got to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不满意可以转身就走 不用承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not satisfied,walk away. No commitments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No commitments."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还真大方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your pitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.69,0:16:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有说不用承诺吗? 我是要你嫁给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I say "No commitments"? I meant marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来两周我都得面对他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I gonna be dealing with this for the next two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以前是杰克的学生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you were one of Jack's students?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 他教我们植物药物学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. He was teaching a seminar on botanical pharmacology.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一完成论文 他就雇用了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon as I finished my dissertation, he hired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.39,0:17:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还真有一手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,that's one way to get a leg-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这话什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我刚毕业时也曾有教授要用我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a professor who wanted to hire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他要我做他的秘书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course,he wanted me to be his secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是不是哪里得罪你啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,if I've done something to offend you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No,dear,not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事实上 我很羡慕你 我花了十年才有今日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,I admire you. Took me 10 years to get where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,显然你们这代找到了捷径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly,your generation has it figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好吃 你在哪学会煮这些菜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,this is good. Where'd you learn to cook like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这是我在斯里兰卡学会的 - 你在那里干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Little recipe I picked up in Sri Lanka. - What were you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无国界医生组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctors Without Borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我平常的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my day job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们预期会需要医生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys expect to need a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保险公司要求要有医生随行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't get the expedition bonded without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们把我当迷人的保险条约就是啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,you just think of me as a charming insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你吃过晚餐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've had your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是怎么说的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有太多的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not that much....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不要睡上面 我也不要睡地板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sleeping up there. I ain't sleeping on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不要睡在那个烂...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't sleeping on no damn....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈的 那是什么? - 那是什么玩意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,shit. What was that? - What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有东西被吃了 - 被什么吃了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something's getting eaten. - By what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything gets eaten out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万物都会被猎食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们有看见小刚吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. You guys seen Kong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨晚之后就没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跑去哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小刚?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果要食品药物管理局同意 我们下个月就需要结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need those results by next month if we want the FDA off our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂?该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我听不见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你听得见我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在听得见吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你现在听得见吗? - 我们都听见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you hear me now? - We can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在听得见吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 葛儿 我的老天 - 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gail! Oh,my God. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快停船!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.97,0:21:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我去救她 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,葛儿 你听得见我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,Gail! Can you hear me now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要宰了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游过来 快 快点 游过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stroke,Gail,stroke. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 小心背后 - 葛儿 水温还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch your back. - Hey,Gail! How's the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把电话扔了 它会妨碍你游泳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the phone. It's probably holding you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好了 抓住 - 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 冷静点 - 把电话当救生浮筒用吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay calm. - Use your phone for flotation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,come on,Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你就快到了 - 把杆子当电话握就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're almost there. - It's just like a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈呀! - 该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holy shit! - Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.55,0:22:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快点! - 快啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out! - Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快点! - 抓好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! Come on! - Gail,grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 小心! - 小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look out! - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刺它!刺它眼睛!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him,Bill! Get him,Bill! Get him in the eye,man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.25,0:22:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比尔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.23,0:23:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.90,0:23:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他人呢? - 比尔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd he go?! - Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.07,0:23:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他到哪去了? - 我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's he gone? - Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.25,0:23:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈咧 你赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit,you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你没事吧? - 我的电话掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're okay? - I lost my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太遗憾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.11,0:24:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这要不是我看过最勇敢的 就是最蠢的行径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was either the bravest or the stupidest thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.95,0:24:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那没多大差别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fine line.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.47,0:24:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没事了 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good as new. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敬葛儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Gail...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她明白与其被吃不如自己大吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who knows it's better to eat than be eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.75,0:24:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 敬葛儿 - 好耶 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To Gail. - Yeah,yeah,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.68,0:24:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了找花儿差点被吃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost eaten just to find a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.65,0:24:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 看起来还真不值得 - 这值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hardly seems worth it. - Oh,it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.06,0:24:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以后每天都要服用的一颗药丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pill that you take every day for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.89,0:24:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算我们一颗最多只卖一元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,even if we charge, say,a dollar a pop...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.53,0:24:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们就是亿万富翁了 - 我就说嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...we're billionaires. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.27,0:24:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我就说嘛 - 一瓶卖一百元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what I'm talking about,baby. - At $100 a bottle...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:25:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连我都愿意去跟鳄鱼搏命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll dive in that river and fight that croc myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.18,0:25:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要多少花才能拯救这世界?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how many flowers does it take to save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.55,0:25:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,50朵花只能生产一盎司的药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figure 50 orchids will yield about an ounce of chemical.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.41,0:25:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算你有一整个球场的花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have a football field full of those orchids...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也还是没办法做人体实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...still doesn't mean you can get it through human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.42,0:25:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她根本就不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't even believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.49,0:25:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干这行就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comes with the territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.16,0:25:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,研究就是要冒点风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In research, you've got to go out on a limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.93,0:25:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总是有人会怀疑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's always someone waiting to chop it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.47,0:25:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跑去哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那东西真该死 - 你跑去哪了 小朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn that thing! - Where you been,boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.21,0:25:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.87,0:25:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 真可怜 - 没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Poor guy. - It's okay. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.91,0:25:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它好像见了鬼似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he's seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.28,0:25:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事了 没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.15,0:25:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一葛儿说中了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Gail's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.79,0:25:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在培养皿里做实验是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,cells in a petri dish are one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.23,0:25:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 人体实验又是另一回事 - 她错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Human trials are another. - She's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.83,0:25:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等不朽之花成品上市之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when it goes to product...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.00,0:26:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你我就能兑现手中的股票买卖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you and I can cash in our stock options...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.87,0:26:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 到时我们再让她好看 - 股票买卖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...we'll rub her face in it. - Stock options.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.07,0:26:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟米契同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spoke to Mitchell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.47,0:26:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各给你们0.5%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're each giving you half a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.88,0:26:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真不知道该说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.58,0:26:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.01,0:26:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是你应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.35,0:26:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.25,0:26:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全都多亏了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wouldn't be possible without your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.39,0:26:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们说好不这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought we decided against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.74,0:26:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过那应该也挺有趣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. It would be fun,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.14,0:26:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在河上游等着我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,here we are, traveling upriver...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我们此生最伟大的发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the greatest discovery of our careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这兰花若真有效 到那时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,if this orchid thing works out,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁知道呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.12,0:26:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我来的原因?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.98,0:26:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你给我们再次发展的机会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can give us one more try?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.89,0:26:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是因为你是最顶尖的研究员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here because you're the best researcher I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:27:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我打扰到你们了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I interrupting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.69,0:27:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No,I was....
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我正打算上床睡觉 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was just going to bed. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.47,0:27:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那之前 我们得谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,before you do that, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.28,0:27:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到水位没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the water level?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.98,0:27:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,水位一高 曼河就很难航行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In high water, the Mendranang gets rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.65,0:27:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以掉头回去找其他河道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could turn around, try to find another course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.32,0:27:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 但那要多花两天时间 - 我们没那么多时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But that would take at least two days. - We don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.73,0:27:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若这河无法通行 就要耗更久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the river becomes impassable, it'll take a lot longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我们掉头回去 就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we turn back, then we're definitely screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.43,0:27:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得冒险一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.34,0:27:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我不想冒险呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I don't wanna risk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.77,0:27:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道这些花代表什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea what this flower means?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.18,0:27:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是历史上最伟大的医药发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about the biggest medical discovery in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:27:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听起来好像很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That does sound great,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我对历史一窍不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was never any good at history.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.12,0:28:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要我冒险强渡曼河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to risk the Mendranang...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就得多花五万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it'll cost you an extra 50 thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.63,0:28:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.57,0:28:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成交?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.60,0:28:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不用去问那个女老板吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta ask the boss lady or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自掏腰包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pay it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.44,0:28:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这么说定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got yourself a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.98,0:28:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但如果有状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we hit trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.38,0:28:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们就得听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your people do what I say, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.48,0:28:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,研究计划?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Research proposals?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.47,0:28:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Research proposals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不是我们唯一的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the only company we're in bed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.81,0:29:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是最抢手 最顶尖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the prettiest and most popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像当红名模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like sleeping with the head cheerleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不尽然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.52,0:29:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少来了 你爱死我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,you know you love us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.42,0:29:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是爱你们的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.39,0:29:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你为什么不让我看档案?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let me get a look at that file.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.39,0:29:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等这个血兰花计划没了 你跟卫合创投就没戏唱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After this orchid thing goes bust, you'll be finished at Wexell-Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除非你还有别的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you got something else lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.56,0:29:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的很想看我们失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really wanna see us fail, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.63,0:29:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.03,0:29:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是认定你们会失败 我毕竟是科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just think that you will. I am a scientist,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.87,0:29:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.34,0:29:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你在卫合创投做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you doing at Wexell-Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜欢科学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like science.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是我更喜欢钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just like money better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.78,0:29:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我敬你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.39,0:30:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,河水泛滥 看不见河岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}River's flooded. We can't see the banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,错过分叉点了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss our turnoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.97,0:30:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 舵卡住了 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rudder's jammed. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.58,0:30:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.89,0:30:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家快起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Everybody up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.19,0:30:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.83,0:31:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.97,0:31:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引擎的衬片坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! We've blown the head gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.14,0:31:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.81,0:31:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.61,0:31:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 怎么了? - 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - We got problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.85,0:31:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 怎么了? - 比尔 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong,man? - Bill,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在扯什么?是什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? What problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.13,0:31:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死 水流太强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch. The current's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.94,0:31:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们错过分叉点了 - 我知道 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We missed our turnoff. - I know. Come on,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.65,0:31:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.32,0:31:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么? - 那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.53,0:32:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看到什么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.63,0:32:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.33,0:32:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你行的 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this. Come on,girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.24,0:32:21.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 大家抓紧了 - 抓什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everybody! Hang on! - Hang on to what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.78,0:32:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.69,0:32:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.11,0:33:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,船沉了!船沉了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sinking,it's sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.72,0:33:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 克尔呢? - 游到岩石那里 往这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Cole? - Swim to the rocks,this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.82,0:33:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.59,0:33:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快 游到岩石那里 - 到岩石那里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on,get to the rocks. - Get to the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.40,0:33:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 克尔呢?克尔! - 在那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Cole? Cole! - Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.80,0:33:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那边!继续游!把手给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.60,0:33:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把手给我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,man. Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.44,0:33:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.78,0:34:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好 珊 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it,Sam. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.65,0:34:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把手给我 我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand. I've got you,I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.49,0:34:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,I got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你差点害死了我们 你差点害死了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost got us killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.66,0:34:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以为我想吗?我的船没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I wanted this? I just lost my damn boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.33,0:34:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不救我们出去 钱也会没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll lose your pay if you don't get us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.37,0:34:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早知有危险 你就该掉头回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you'd get us there safely. You should've turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.74,0:34:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.60,0:34:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在吵这个一点用也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing we can do about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.97,0:34:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是浪费精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a waste of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.71,0:34:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还剩什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.18,0:34:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一些标本罐 地图... 一些水 没有食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some specimen jars, a map,a little water,no food.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,硬碟挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard drive's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.26,0:34:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几乎所有装备都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,pretty much all the equipment's shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.43,0:34:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除了一具卫星电话 上网用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except one of the SAT phones still works. It's on-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.47,0:34:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感谢上天 我们可以找警察了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God,we can call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.60,0:35:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最近的巡逻队在帕兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police. The nearest river patrol is back in Padrang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.07,0:35:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要找到我们就得越过那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way to get to us is over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.11,0:35:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们被困在这里了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying we're stuck here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.45,0:35:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.68,0:35:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在这 整个河谷都被淹没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here. The valley's completely flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.65,0:35:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我有朋友在托库河开船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got a friend who operates a boat on the Tokut River.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.22,0:35:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以打电话找他 请他到纳加岩接我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give him a call,and he can meet us here at Naga Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.10,0:35:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那有多远?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.23,0:35:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道 沿着河走一两天吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. A two-day hike down the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.13,0:35:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但如果穿越丛林 可以减少一天的路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we bushwhack, we cut at least a day off the trek.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.87,0:35:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要走那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God. You wanna go through that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.94,0:35:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是最短的路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the shortest way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.71,0:35:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,傍晚就能平安到达托库河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could be safely in the Tokut by nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.75,0:35:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们就能继续探险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we can continue with the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.38,0:35:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是啊 我会送你去找花 - 算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. I'll get you to the flower. - I don't care about that flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.02,0:35:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 安全第一 - 那没有冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...just get us to safety. - It's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.06,0:35:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以在十小时内坐上船 或在这呆坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can either be on my buddy's boat in 10 hours,or we can sit here...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.69,0:35:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几天等巡逻队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and wait for the river patrol for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.86,0:36:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你朋友 他靠得住吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend. Is he reliable?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.20,0:36:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.30,0:36:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你最好别搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better not screw me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.31,0:36:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听起来你已经搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you're already screwed,mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.51,0:36:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我付你两千元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay you two grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.08,0:36:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you on this one,John.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.05,0:36:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,yes,so it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说 我很想帮你 但我真的穷翻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,Billy,I'd love to help you out, but I'm flat out,mate,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.59,0:36:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许你可以出五千?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably squeeze you in for, say,5 grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.06,0:36:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.09,0:36:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是交情价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's mates rates. Or you could always...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.23,0:36:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想省钱可以自己走回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...hike back to Padrang if you wanna save bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.93,0:36:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 就看你了 - 好吧 五千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up to you,pal. - Fine. Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.50,0:36:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 帅啊! - 但你最好别失约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! - But you better be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.44,0:36:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不然我把你的丑事跟你老婆说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise,I'll tell your wife about that little trip to Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老婆早跑啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wife's long gone,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.28,0:36:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早跑啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long gone,mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.78,0:36:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(李文斯顿私人财产)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.95,0:36:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 谈好了 准备上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,people,we're on. Saddle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.89,0:37:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家别走散了 这丛林很茂密 很容易迷路的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay together. This jungle is all green all the time,and you will get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.22,0:37:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这活像在三温暖里踩登山机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like doing a StairMaster in a sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.55,0:37:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 我搞不好会中暑而死 但我铁定能练出紧翘的屁部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I might die of a heat stroke, but I'll have a nice tight ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.19,0:37:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就对了 克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the spirit,Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.06,0:37:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要我帮你拿吗? - 这不是废话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want me to grab that? - ls that a trick question?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.41,0:37:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐在名人堆里看球...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right between Spike and Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.61,0:37:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐在名人堆里看球...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right between Spike and Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.11,0:37:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还好吧 珊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay,Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:37:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.35,0:38:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,危机让人能看清真正的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See,a crisis separates the real men from the pretenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.26,0:38:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 我看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.63,0:38:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What,that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.43,0:38:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.84,0:38:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我骗他帮我拿背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tricked him into taking my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.72,0:38:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我试试看吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Mind if I give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.49,0:38:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随你便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.83,0:38:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.03,0:38:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很遗憾你的船没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.30,0:38:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉 真是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正它也挺烂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it was a piece of shit anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.27,0:39:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能绕过去吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go around?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.00,0:39:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以 但那就得多浪费一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,we could. But we'd lose another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.15,0:39:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.55,0:39:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.78,0:40:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈啦 那是什么? - 什么是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! What was that? - What was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.82,0:40:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有东西滑过去 - 拜托你别乱说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something just moved. - Please don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.29,0:40:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说真的 有东西滑过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious. Something moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.95,0:40:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,活的东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Something just moved" as in something's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.39,0:40:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 又来了 这里面有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! There it is again. There's something in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.09,0:40:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能有上百万种生物吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's probably a million things in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.46,0:40:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说的对 继续走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right. Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.08,0:41:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.35,0:41:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我发誓 你再不停...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God,if you don't stop it....
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.99,0:41:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.43,0:41:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.77,0:41:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他人呢? - 该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd he go? - Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.58,0:41:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.11,0:42:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那是什么鬼玩意? - 森蚺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell was that thing?! - Anaconda.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.38,0:42:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这下可好了! - 这里有那么大的蛇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,great! - There's snakes out here that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.85,0:42:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 对 不过... - 不过什么?它把他给吞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes,but... - But what? It swallowed him whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.62,0:42:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冷静下来听我说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down and listen for a second. I can explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.42,0:42:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你才冷静下来听我说 班被一条超级大蟒蛇给吞了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,you calm down and listen! Ben was eaten by a freaking snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.99,0:42:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 超级大蟒蛇! - 克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? A freaking snake! - Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.56,0:42:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 老天!老天! - 克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,God. Oh,my God. I mean.... - Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.53,0:42:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天!老天! 你们有看到那玩意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God,did you see that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.87,0:42:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们根本打不赢它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't got a chance against that!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.14,0:42:49.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说 米契 米契 你听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,Mitchell. Mitchell. Listen to me,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.64,0:42:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 我常看探索频道 我跟你说 我们毫无胜算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watch the Discovery Channel. I'm telling you,we got no chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.11,0:42:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就像小老鼠一样 你们明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're like mice in an aquarium. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.61,0:42:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们死定了 我们死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,we're gonna die,girl. We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.25,0:43:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克尔 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole,calm down. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.19,0:43:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好吗? - 好 杰克 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? - All right,Jack,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.36,0:43:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会乖乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'll just....
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.76,0:43:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.29,0:43:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会乖乖坐在这里 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna sit right here. I'm sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.03,0:43:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 南美大蟒蛇是有地盘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. Anacondas are territorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.63,0:43:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种大小的蛇地盘一定很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A snake that size will hunt a huge area.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.74,0:43:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几公里以内不会有其他的蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be another one for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.71,0:43:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得去坐船 那里没那么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get to the boat. It's not that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.94,0:43:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要我们一起继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if we keep moving and stick together...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.82,0:43:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 就应该不会有事 - 应该不会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...we should be fine. - We should be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.22,0:43:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们会长多大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How big do they get?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.65,0:43:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我看过最大条的了 变种怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the biggest one I've ever seen by far. A freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.49,0:43:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再遇见另一条这么大的机率很低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The odds of running into another that size are astronomical.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.69,0:43:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吞了班的那条难道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,but how do we know the one that got Ben...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.26,0:43:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会追我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is not gonna come after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.67,0:43:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们要花好几个星期消化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes them weeks to digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.90,0:43:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么大块的肉 能让它安静好一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meal like that, he'll be sleeping it off for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.61,0:44:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们赶快去搭船回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get to that boat and get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.82,0:44:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那血兰花呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the orchid?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.02,0:44:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.72,0:44:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它要再过七年才会再开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't bloom for another seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.99,0:44:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 探险已经结束了 杰克 - 等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This expedition is over,Jack. - Now,hold on a second,Gail.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.09,0:44:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这上面可投注了不少金钱 - 我不在乎 班死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a lot of money at stake here. - I don't care. Ben is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.70,0:44:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have lost someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.87,0:44:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,身为卫合创投代表 我取消探险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Wexell-Hall's representative, I am calling this expedition off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.37,0:44:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你无权这么做 - 去看看合约吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't have the authority. - Check your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.84,0:44:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在丛林里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the middle of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.88,0:44:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的话要我们听才算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this point,your authority is what we say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.95,0:44:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我同意她的看法 我要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack,I'm with her. I gotta get the hell out of here,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.79,0:44:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说 班也是我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Ben was my friend,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.83,0:44:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我请他来的 没有人心情会比我更恶劣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him into this,and no one feels worse about it than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.40,0:44:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我并不想做什么蠢事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.23,0:44:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只想完成我们来此的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna accomplish what we came here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.87,0:44:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们若放弃 班的死就没意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we turn back now, Ben's death would be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.61,0:45:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们先去搭船吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get back to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.35,0:45:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到时再重新组队做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can regroup and make our decision then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.45,0:45:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.30,0:45:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.83,0:45:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 也许葛儿是对的 - 她只是害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe Gail's right. - She's just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.97,0:45:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等搭上船就没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we get back to the boat, she'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.51,0:45:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等我们搭上船 探险就宣告结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we get back to the boat, this expedition is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.81,0:45:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只送大家去安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking these people to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.25,0:45:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们说好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey,hey. We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.32,0:45:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把你的钱留着吧 有人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your money,doc. Someone is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.75,0:45:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在的状况可不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're officially in over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.99,0:45:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说过不会再遇到大蟒蛇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we wouldn't run into another one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.66,0:45:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能不会 但我无法保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we probably won't, but I can't guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.66,0:45:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我会送你们上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll get you to the boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.63,0:46:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那之后 我们就毫无瓜葛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and after that we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.50,0:46:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来答案很明显了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,that answers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.04,0:46:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那不代表什么 等我们上船后我会给他更多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That answers nothing. I'll just throw more money at him at the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.81,0:46:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是他拒绝 我就找他朋友 给一样的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he doesn't take it, I'll offer his friend the same deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.34,0:46:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 杰克 我们应该要听... - 要是我们现在采不到血兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack. Maybe we should listen... - If we don't get to that orchid now...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.08,0:46:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的努力就付诸流水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all of our work will have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.62,0:46:23.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我需要你的支持 好吗? 这次探险对你我而言都很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your support,okay? You have as much riding on this as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.25,0:46:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.13,0:46:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动物星球频道播过 大蟒蛇很凶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw this special on Animal Planet. Anacondas are vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.40,0:46:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们猎杀只是好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They hunt for sport. Don't even need to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.00,0:46:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们用舌头感测猎物的体温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just use their tongues to sense body heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.30,0:46:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托你闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.67,0:46:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我朋友的朋友是拍纪录片的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew this guy who knew this guy who shot documentaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.71,0:46:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他曾经带一组人去亚马逊河 结果全都被蛇吞了 是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went to the Amazon with this crew, and they were all eaten by snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.68,0:46:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 那只是谣传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,you knew a guy who knew a guy,that's an urban myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.22,0:47:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班的事我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.86,0:47:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不该继续在曼河上航行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never should've stayed on the Mendranang.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.17,0:47:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这话什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.90,0:47:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想他不会告诉其他人 但我以为你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I figured he didn't tell the others, but I thought you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.74,0:47:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knew what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.41,0:47:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克多付我五万叫我继续开船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Byron offered me an extra 50 grand to stay on the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.94,0:47:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我告诉他情况不妙 但他想冒险一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him it might get rough, but he wanted to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.15,0:47:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别怪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.25,0:47:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.75,0:47:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我接受了他的出价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以为我可以把大家送到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I could get us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.96,0:47:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想怪任何人 就怪我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna blame anyone? You blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.54,0:47:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这双靴子真是害惨我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These boots are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.94,0:47:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 克尔 - 干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cole. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.55,0:47:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的脖子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some....
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.59,0:48:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀 那是什么?快把它弄掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God,what is that?! Get it off! Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.29,0:48:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快弄掉! - 别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh,my God! Take it off! - Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.32,0:48:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 救命!救命! - 别乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me! Help me! - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.96,0:48:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 救命 帮我弄掉它! - 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get it off me! - Hey! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.06,0:48:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 帮我弄掉! - 冷静点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get this off me! - Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.66,0:48:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克尔 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cole! Cole! Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.36,0:48:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.33,0:48:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快弄掉啊 - 好了 你看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get it off me. Get it off. - All right. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.87,0:48:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这只是个打火机 - 不行 你不能烧我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just a lighter. Just a lighter. - Oh,hell no! You ain't burning me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.67,0:48:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 好 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.44,0:48:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你烧伤我 我就宰了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You burn me,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.68,0:48:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好 好 好... - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay,okay,okay. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.29,0:48:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你还好吧? - 还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? You okay? - Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.06,0:48:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 怎么了? - 等等 手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Hold on. Put your arms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.49,0:48:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.86,0:48:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干嘛摸我衣服底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you going under my shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.80,0:48:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你干嘛?怎么回事? - 老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.30,0:48:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What,what? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.57,0:48:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么?到底是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.27,0:48:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人有带火把吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody got a blowtorch?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.66,0:49:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么... - 那玩意若咬到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's it... - If that thing bit you...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.94,0:49:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就瘫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you would be lumpuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.10,0:49:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像石头一样麻痹两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paralyzed,like stone,for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.65,0:49:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这家伙叫什么名字? - "拉巴巴图" 石蜘蛛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you call this fella? - Laba laba batu. Stone spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.79,0:49:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我帮卫合创投找到下一个标的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have discovered a valuable new anesthetic agent for Wexell-Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.49,0:49:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别管卫合创投了 这可以吸引到更好的金主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,no,no,no. Forget Wexell, we can get this to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.53,0:49:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 献宝时间结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Show and tell's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.17,0:50:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得赶去搭船了 快穿上鞋 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get to that boat. Put your boots on and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.35,0:50:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugger it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.32,0:50:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么玩意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.71,0:50:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.54,0:51:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天啊 那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.05,0:51:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.11,0:51:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.35,0:51:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.42,0:51:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不...不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no! Oh,come on,man!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.23,0:51:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.53,0:51:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,李文斯顿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Livingston!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.67,0:51:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原因在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.47,0:51:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他喝醉摔下船了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got drunk and fell off the bloody boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.51,0:51:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你朋友!现在我们该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend! Your friend! Now what we gonna do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.68,0:51:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈啦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.45,0:51:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搜寻残骸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search the wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.52,0:52:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找出任何可用的物资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find anything we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.63,0:52:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也希望能找到电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And hope to God there's a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.05,0:52:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.65,0:52:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.03,0:52:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.06,0:52:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.80,0:52:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 拜托 快通啊! - 有回应吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on,come on! - Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.93,0:52:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没有 - 继续试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. - Keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.60,0:52:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以为我在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think I'm doing,Jack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.94,0:52:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.98,0:52:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回答啊 哈啰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,man. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.58,0:52:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(信号弹)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.52,0:53:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续找!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,keep looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.74,0:53:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有电话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.54,0:53:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没有 - 无线电也没回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. - Couldn't get a signal on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.21,0:53:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.86,0:53:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.80,0:53:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些是哪来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd these come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.86,0:53:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 罗帕族 - 谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lopaks. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.90,0:53:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原住民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Local tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.40,0:53:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 猎头族的后裔 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Descended from headhunters. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.87,0:53:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们居住在此已数千年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been in this region for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.27,0:53:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 猎头族? - 这附近还有一些村落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Headhunters? - There's still some villages here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.14,0:54:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这是他们钓鱼的地方 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Must be one of their fishing spots. - Hold on,excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.18,0:54:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说"猎头族"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you say headhunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.52,0:54:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们已经超过一世纪没猎头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There haven't been practicing headhunters in Borneo for a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.35,0:54:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没猎并不代表不记得怎么猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because they ain't practicing don't mean they don't remember how.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.96,0:54:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们一定住在这个支流的岸边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be along this branch of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.16,0:54:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以去找他们的村落 也许他们能借船给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can find their village, maybe they can lend us a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.83,0:54:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我等一等 去找猎头族 而不是逃命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So wait a minute. We just gonna walk towards the headhunters,not away?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.47,0:54:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.07,0:54:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 早死早超生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,yeah,that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.96,0:54:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我饿到愿意拿我阿嬷换一颗糖果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God. I'm so hungry,I'd sell my grandmother for a Tic Tac.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.27,0:54:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你敢再提食物的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mention food one more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.77,0:55:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就投票让你出局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm voting you off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.25,0:55:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.85,0:55:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那是不是... - 李文斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that... - Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.19,0:55:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天 他出了什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God,man. What the hell happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.99,0:55:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大蟒蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anaconda.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.33,0:55:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若是蛇吞了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he was eaten by the snake...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.06,0:55:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 为什么又... - 听着 听着 给我听着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is his body... - Listen,listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.80,0:55:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些家伙在消化食物时很脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. These things are at their weakest when they digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.14,0:55:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但若遭受威胁 它们就会吐出食物 再度攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if threatened,they will spit up their food and attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.45,0:55:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是说有条蛇空着肚子到处逛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? There's a snake out there with an empty stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.62,0:55:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 对 - 是吞了班的同一条吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - The same one that got Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.92,0:55:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不是的 不可能是同一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. There's no way that snake could've gotten to Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.06,0:55:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 一定是另外一条 - 你说过几公里内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It had to be another one. - You said there wouldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.09,0:55:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不会有其他蛇的 - 是不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...another one for miles. - There wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.90,0:56:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 除非... - 除非什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unless.... - Unless what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.20,0:56:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 除非是交配季节 - 我的妈呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unless it's mating season. - Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 交配季节? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mating season? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.10,0:56:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公蛇是有地盘的 但当它们闻到母蛇发情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see,the males are territorial, but when they smell a female in heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.64,0:56:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们就会从四面八方聚集过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they come running from everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.85,0:56:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,母蛇会找一个潮湿的泥坑 公蛇会一起找上母蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Females find a nice,wet,muddy pit, and they all go after her at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.32,0:56:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,形成一个臣大的交配蛇球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in one big mating ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.42,0:56:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以那些蟒蛇在开轰趴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's some snake orgy out in the jungle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.92,0:56:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.46,0:56:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 天快黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,we're losing the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.26,0:56:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得尽快抵达村落 所以请大家注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we gotta do is get to that village. So please,pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.00,0:56:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别脱队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not stray from the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.91,0:56:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.82,0:57:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保持安静 神圣的墓地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay quiet. Sacred burial ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.99,0:57:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.03,0:57:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说过那是你看过最大条的大蟒蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said that anaconda was the biggest you'd ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.84,0:57:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.44,0:57:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 但这条... - 更大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well,this one's.... - Bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.17,0:57:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公蛇一定都跑来找母蛇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The males must've come through here looking for the female.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.89,0:58:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这太扯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.03,0:58:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他们搭船走了 - 他们走得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They took their boats. - Good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.36,0:58:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对我们可不好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.47,0:58:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪一条是曼河?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one's the Mendranang?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.80,0:58:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,右边那条 左边是托库河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the right. The Tokut keeps going to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.17,0:58:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 那是到新高打最快的路线 - 要多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fastest way to Kotabaru. - How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.14,0:58:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两天内就能在五星级饭店里泡澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be soaking in a tub at the Four Seasons in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.28,0:58:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们连船都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How,man? We don't even have a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.38,0:58:33.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们自己造一艘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna build one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.61,0:59:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样拆别人房子 不被打死才怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,do that in my neighborhood, and that's your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.28,0:59:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乱扯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.85,0:59:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,珊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.76,0:59:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得这像什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does this look like to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.70,1:00:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.84,1:00:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不朽之花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perrinia immortalis.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.98,1:00:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在知道那些蛇为何这么大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we know why these snakes are so big.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.48,1:00:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.91,1:00:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,森蚺到死之前都还会继续成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anacondas keep growing till they die,right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.78,1:00:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些是比尔看过最大的蟒蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these are the biggest Bill's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.88,1:00:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 因为它们活的比较长 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because they're living longer. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.49,1:00:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为不朽之花进入了食物链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Perrinia immortalis is part of the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.89,1:00:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些蛇超越了海夫利克极限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These snakes have transcended the Hayflick limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.66,1:00:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,花的药性如我们预期的起了作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chemical in the orchid does exactly what we predicted.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.16,1:00:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而这不是理论 是真正的实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not in theory,in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.50,1:00:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是证明 确认了你的研究成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is proof,Sam, of your research,carved in stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.97,1:00:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是证明?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is proof?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.01,1:00:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这最多只算是个趣闻罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's anecdotal evidence at best.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.28,1:00:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们去采花 查明一切吧 - 你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get to the orchid and find out. - You are out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.72,1:00:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我们有多接近那些花吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how close we are?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.73,1:01:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,血兰花的发现地在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The orchid was found here...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.33,1:01:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在曼河上 靠近下一个湾道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on the Mendranang, just around the next bend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.14,1:01:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们会经过 - 我们不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll be going right past it. - No,we won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.17,1:01:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要走托库河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going down the Tokut.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.04,1:01:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我们继续走曼河 要花一周才能到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we go down the Mendranang, it's gonna be a week...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.88,1:01:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一个村落 我可不想等那么久才洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before we reach another village. I'm not waiting that long for my bath.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.79,1:01:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,决定权不在你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,well,it's not up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.96,1:01:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.76,1:01:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你可以改天再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can just come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.36,1:01:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过七年再来?万一花不见了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In seven years? What if it's not here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.37,1:01:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一有人决定开恳整个盆地呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if some local farmer decides to slash and burn the entire basin?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.47,1:01:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果稻田取代了不老泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of the fountain of youth, we'll have a giant rice paddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.54,1:01:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我们唯一的机会 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our only chance. You know it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.45,1:01:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们都到这了 你真的要放弃?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna give in when we're this close?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.85,1:01:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说 你知道我支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. You know I got your back,right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.72,1:02:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一起面对过无数困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been in the trenches a hundred times together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 但我不打算进那个丛林 - 真直接啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I'm not going in that jungle. - Damn straight,man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.20,1:02:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.24,1:02:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我的探险 我们要去采兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my expedition, and we're going to the orchid.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.48,1:02:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.81,1:02:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.62,1:02:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别傻了 珊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be an idiot,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.42,1:02:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 这比盘尼西林还伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bigger than penicillin, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.09,1:02:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这药可以救人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lives will be saved by this drug.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.92,1:02:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人将可以活的更久 更年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People will live longer. They'll stay young longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.63,1:02:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我们不进行人体实验 就太没人性了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't put this to human trials, it'll be a crime against humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.03,1:02:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经死了两个人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two people have died already.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.67,1:02:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,科学家本来就是要冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scientists have always risked their lives to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.97,1:02:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有他们冒险 我们就无法... 治愈黄热病 小儿嘛痹 天花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they didn't,we wouldn't have cures for yellow fever,polio and smallpox.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.37,1:02:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们都清楚这些危险 - 我们以为我们很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all knew the risks. - We thought we did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.48,1:02:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直到你开始背着我们做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until you decided to start making decisions behind our backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.82,1:03:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你说什么? - 他加价五万叫比尔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - He offered Bill an extra 50 grand...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.85,1:03:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续走曼河 而他很清楚曼河很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to keep going,even though he knew it wasn't safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.06,1:03:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.20,1:03:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that true,Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.90,1:03:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我这是为了探险 - 你是为了自己的前途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was thinking of the expedition. - You were thinking of your career.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.74,1:03:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 你是我的助理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. You're my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.04,1:03:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不需要征询你的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need to consult you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.82,1:03:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有权做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one with the authority here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.92,1:03:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在丛林里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the middle of the jungle,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.49,1:03:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在此时 你的话要我们听才算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this point,your authority is what we say it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.67,1:03:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来有人不听你指挥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess you got a mutiny on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.96,1:04:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 抬高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Keep it high.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.20,1:04:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.30,1:04:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把它放中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Center it right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.24,1:04:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.95,1:04:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.02,1:04:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没看过男人刮胡子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never seen a man shave before?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.56,1:04:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能在你杀短吻鳄之前比较锐利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably a lot sharper before you attacked that alligator.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.90,1:04:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是长吻鳄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.47,1:04:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那代表什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.80,1:05:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"新的开始" 是韩文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means "a new beginning." It's Korean.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.51,1:05:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当兵时纹的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it when I was in the military.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.21,1:05:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么会来这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What brought you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.01,1:05:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 说来话长 - 反正我现在也不急着走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Long story. - Where am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.92,1:05:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.22,1:05:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事情是这样的 我本来在特种部队服役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the deal. I was in the Special Forces...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.89,1:05:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我亲眼目赌也做了一些...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I saw and did things...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.36,1:05:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想忘却的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I wanted to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.53,1:05:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有时人会为了正义而做错事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes we do the wrong things for the right reasons,you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.20,1:05:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,故事其实并没那么长嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not very long,as stories go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.67,1:05:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.24,1:05:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我退役之后 来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I got out of the military...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.64,1:05:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,买下了"血腥玛丽"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...came here and bought the Bloody Mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.11,1:05:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是想开始新的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wanted to start a new life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.90,1:06:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.05,1:06:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(李文斯顿私人财产)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.83,1:06:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,数到三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On three.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.36,1:06:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了吗?一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? One,two,three.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.30,1:06:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It works.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.51,1:06:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.86,1:07:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.73,1:07:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么没把这件事告诉我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why in the hell didn't you tell me about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.10,1:07:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有人打通电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The minute someone makes a call...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.34,1:07:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,探险就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this expedition's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.87,1:07:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.67,1:07:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只求多几小时时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm asking for is a few more hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.18,1:07:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们先继续沿着曼河过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We continue on the Mendranang...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.18,1:07:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,采取样本之后再打电话求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take our orchid samples, then we call for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.48,1:07:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别想了 我要救大家出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about it,Jack. I'm getting us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.72,1:07:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要想清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about this,Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.82,1:07:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就快成为亿万富翁了 你真的想放弃这一切?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to become a billionaire. Do you really want to give all that up?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.06,1:07:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不在乎什么钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about the money, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.43,1:07:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.24,1:07:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它咬了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It bit me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.05,1:08:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你干嘛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack,what are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.52,1:08:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.00,1:08:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.11,1:08:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.52,1:08:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.69,1:08:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米契呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Mitchell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.26,1:08:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Resting his feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.16,1:08:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要不要我去叫他? - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should I go get him? - No,no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.23,1:08:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 等一切就绪再去叫他吧 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let him rest till we get loaded. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.80,1:08:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他脚上的水泡很严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those blisters are pretty nasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.69,1:09:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米契\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitchell...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.22,1:09:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.13,1:09:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米契?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitchell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.26,1:09:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.80,1:09:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.31,1:10:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把他怎么了 杰克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do to him,Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.94,1:10:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 怎么了? - 米契出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - Something's wrong with Mitchell.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.58,1:10:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么意思? - 你刚跟他在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - You were alone with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.45,1:10:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.39,1:10:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在休息 我什么也没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was resting his feet. I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.43,1:10:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 糟糕 - 我的老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit. - Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.44,1:10:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.98,1:10:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,葛儿 别叫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gail,no! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.22,1:10:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出去!快出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.69,1:10:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快!快啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.69,1:10:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快跑啊!快跑啊!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move! Move! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.04,1:11:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竹筏!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The raft!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.91,1:11:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不!你这个混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.42,1:11:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以再造一艘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can build another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.18,1:11:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用什么建?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.62,1:11:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用什么建?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With what,Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.26,1:11:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得搭上竹筏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get to the raft.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.02,1:11:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 才能离开这里 - 拜托 竹筏已经没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's our only way out of here. - FYl,Bill,the raft is gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.36,1:11:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们可以再弄回来 - 怎么弄?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can get it back. - How?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.16,1:11:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游泳去追吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How? We gonna swim after it now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.94,1:11:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,村落在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the village is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.41,1:11:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杰克正沿着曼河过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack is following the Mendranang.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.04,1:11:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们穿过丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cut across the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.18,1:11:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 就能在另一边拦截到他 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can catch him on the other side. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.55,1:11:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 在哪里拦? - 他去找血兰花了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Catch him where? - He's going to that orchid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.82,1:11:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要找到血兰花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find that flower...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.56,1:12:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就能找到竹筏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we find that raft.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.68,1:12:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感谢天 我是杰克拜伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,thank God. It's Jack Byron.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.11,1:12:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说 我们出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.48,1:12:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走错河道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took the wrong way on the Mendranang.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.65,1:12:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结果遇到瀑布翻覆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went over a waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.32,1:12:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之后我就没见到任何人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen anyone since. I am....
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.92,1:12:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我是唯一幸存的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.56,1:12:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait,wait. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.40,1:12:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.58,1:13:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它在我们前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in front of us.
