Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.95,1:23:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.49,1:23:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you just let him die.
