Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.09,1:23:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was I supposed to do,Sam?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.53,1:23:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 做正确的决定? - 只要开始永远不嫌晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The right thing? - It's always a good place to start.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.24,1:23:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你别做傻事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not be stupid about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.44,1:24:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去采花 然后就能回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get to the flower, we can all go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.05,1:24:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,交配蛇球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mating ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.52,1:24:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,火把给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the flare.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.46,1:24:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把他绑起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.63,1:24:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.82,1:25:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把花装满背包 - 你别开玩笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fill it up. - You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.92,1:25:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看起来像开玩笑吗?快去装!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like I'm kidding?! Fill it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.08,1:25:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.42,1:25:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快去采花 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now get the flowers. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.36,1:26:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把背包扔给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw me the pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.67,1:26:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把枪放下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.28,1:26:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把背包扔给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw me the pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.40,1:27:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快起来 比尔 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up,Bill! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.57,1:27:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,man!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.81,1:27:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.39,1:27:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.96,1:27:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 珊 快爬啊! - 珊 快爬啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam,come on! - Sam! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.33,1:27:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快爬过来 快点! - 快爬啊 珊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on,girl! Hurry up! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.14,1:27:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 珊 快点! - 快爬啊 珊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam! Come on! - Come on! Hurry up,Sam!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.64,1:27:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你行的 加油 - 你行的 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on,baby! - You got it,honey,come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.41,1:28:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.72,1:28:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 加油 快! - 就快到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on,baby. - You got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.65,1:28:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你行的 加油 - 加油 就快到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got it,honey! - Almost there! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.49,1:28:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 蜘蛛! - 手伸过来 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spider.... - Reach for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.69,1:28:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点!伸长点!再过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Sam,please! Just reach! Reach!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.87,1:28:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.81,1:28:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快点! - 在这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Right here,Sam! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.82,1:28:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不 不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.49,1:28:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.44,1:28:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦!老天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,God!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.58,1:29:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续爬! 继续爬!加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Sam! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.51,1:29:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 继续爬! - 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep coming! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.15,1:29:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续爬上来! 继续爬!加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb up that wall,Sam! Keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.19,1:29:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续爬!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.55,1:29:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 加油! - 继续爬!我抓住你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Come on. I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.23,1:29:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来!快过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Sam,get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.23,1:29:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 该死!哦 该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shit! Oh,shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.11,1:29:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.74,1:29:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里 臭家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here,bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.18,1:30:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的老天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.12,1:30:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.82,1:30:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就说嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.66,1:30:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.53,1:31:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个还蛮登对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two look like you made up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.19,1:31:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它其实还不坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.53,1:31:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.53,1:31:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.30,1:31:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我死不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.84,1:31:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.84,1:31:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有你在身边也挺不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of nice having you around.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.28,1:31:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我还要多久才能洗澡? - 到新高打市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So how much further to my bath? - Kotabaru?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.08,1:31:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.05,1:31:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 一天 - 一天?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...another day downriver. - Another day?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.35,1:31:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我可不想再划一天了 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not rowing another day,homeboy. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.95,1:32:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们可以走那条捷径...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see,we got this shortcut right up...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.59,1:32:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
